From bd8123a7cb266fc2a5d61353efcb6a9bde8bd303 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UniFrog CI <ci@unifrog.local>
Date: Sun, 10 May 2026 23:38:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add SF2000 gpsp_multicore safety hooks

Enable in-memory ROM loading for the SF2000 host, add load progress callbacks, and carry the gpSP MIPS dynarec safety guards into gpsp_multicore.
---
 common.h            |  9 +++++++
 cpu_threaded.c      | 12 ++++++---
 gba_memory.c        | 66 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 libretro/libretro.c | 11 ++++++++
 main.c              |  7 ++++-
 mips/mips_emit.h    | 18 ++++++++++---
 mips/mips_stub.S    | 47 ++++++++++++++++++++------------
 7 files changed, 142 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)

diff --git a/common.h b/common.h
